        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana ZA2006/24, ZA Series Modern 24 Inch Double Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe modern feel of this Deltana ZA2006/24 double towel bar makes it great for any contemporary setting. The contemporary square shape brings interesting design to the lowly towel bar. The 24\" length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made of zinc and aluminum. This Modern Value series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZA2006_24-specifications.gif?v=1704354568\" width=\"600\" height=\"188\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana ZA2006/24 24\" Double Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-modern-value-towel-bar-deltana-za2003-24\"><b>24\" ZA Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana ZA Series\"><b>Deltana ZA Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the ZA 24 Inch Double Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: zinc and aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 23-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length center to center: 22-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1-1/8\" squared</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-ZA2006_24.pdf?v=1704262295\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana ZA2006/24 24\" Double Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "24 Inch Modern Value Double Towel Bar, Deltana ZA2006/24",
                "description": "Deltana ZA2006/24, ZA Series Modern 24 Inch Double Towel Bar - The modern feel of this Deltana ZA2006/24 double towel bar makes it great for any contemporary setting. The contemporary square shape brings interesting design to the lowly towel bar. The 24 inch length means that is it large enough to hold more than one towel at a time. Made of zinc and aluminum, it is available in polished chrome and satin nickel finishes. This Modern Value series towel bar is made with the excellent quality for which Deltana is known.",
